{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1398,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db2a665787b7ee4214b6bb1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我真的成为一颗闪耀光芒的钻石了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ada910c3951d595ada879e5b740b467b3fc86935e432b93c0d112da29afd11b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f017bcec143d334f23e5665d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从山顶看见的光芒真美呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ef411ad7beabca11cb25b1322b088e1502cd63f28f9914f0c637c7c3e7bbe4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cd2c223329bbc8fe975bd21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起持续绽放不变的光辉吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce0ae6c61f47e6fd8e887511ae42e5baed8372428eaf1241e879030b3bb0411",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e36a2ef286fd41ef745dda3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "信じてくれたあなたに、この輝きを捧げます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d4dce114a00cfab92435f9b72063bf86dccbb9a17e034471c39ca0d70b54472",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed6393bceccef31ade58102c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可能なんて言葉、\r\nどこにもないって証明できました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29a7a0dd771c4b523132c78de4cd0223132be8b05b94ccbd18014e48255a9a72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77e5e8b00ae14e1e4852369f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "继续磨练自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "907838f821fc59b07dede3bb1e951731743907b0e3e93440c4388f189a8fe284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0054792472eb3f4017038321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要更加闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c66a917e55b4abb1ac3cf97362302b17201354d9abb077b86bf0d480704b5b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:196cfd270253cd0bfeb9473c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是的，\r\n我就是里见光钻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c15926fe0e0fa2ebdb6375ccece7104161ef7d9117c2f02fcd9fb8be2b41abc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d705fb60a6c9cb4a05d91ff5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要用钻石的光辉\r\n打碎所有高墙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29d1d931af6f3aefd04dc55db72d751477b6cb4c9c5db90785980ccdc2d37fd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54c88366c820907739dd7df4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望能助你一臂之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6032998a1aac5a206878c99b496116aa89309321807af18981ef522e4300c992",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89c92a33c6f9d93975eafa99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会辜负你对我的信赖♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e63fd69f95d4634ebd91536b64ea7530defce29b85ae18a72b332c0813aea40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45b77a1bd702099095238130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怀着高洁的精神前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c83e082fcc6535e7496d834fc373841df67d424cc450d4d5565e78e0e16e640f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86aeead4ce4d1bdda217c594",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像新年的日出那样，\r\n耀眼地升起吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e46cdd2e9c170ba16f2d895f4cf94620d4965961fe1b36c7ccfa145245c60cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17693946ba05db82932cb695",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要如新年的日出般，\r\n绽放永恒不变的光辉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e20f2a147c1276f95180217f23284b04818ae4387ecdbf5bd664da5f49bf0a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f97462aa7b66c83d41fb5f73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是里见光钻。\r\n朝耀眼的巅峰迈进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c97d62ae78fe3ec56bc733532ca61b89261806e5cb163e0cd8e604c106ca306d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75efde60aeb8b653deca6818",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研ぎ澄ましましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c96af8830a1deb9e3a9cb074bfe56066f859774f52b79ffee7ff36ba8dbb75cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7e57d9b57cc68e798f11cec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "また1つ、壁を壊しました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8814aacd0615f38142988014c98b8fc1ab3db2222978bbdc40ed2b510a44e78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62f5b3caad655ceadb1c0af9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、この剣で…門を閉ざす茨を\r\n打ち破りましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70cd4cd717d7fe6e87d7c9266fde78fb2956e5b517486ab68e75eb45d9288de9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7c59a80a2fa778c6eb93433",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oui ! サトノダイヤモンド、参ります！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5728997a8afd45f5da79a43d6c4b423ac330a75eb725540fd474d8b2d443a15a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:282e28ae475f42cb8b08a7e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛就是祭典！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1041ceeffb66463507282725f8c0e80850ef0bfefb6ab2a02d2620499caff603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3816dd3a8b2dacc91ede1ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要心中的火焰尚未熄灭……\r\n我就会努力持续拼命锻炼，\r\n总有一天要答谢大家的恩情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f72f47727e91a19b369132023cfd31c8e334426d296f9e13b706381d85f7dce2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:612c19fdbb5dceba92f4631d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c72dfae705efcef65bc49b38a341c58d191b306f83675cb9c5b9126795dcaea6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7dceed4b824fd0af4fe45d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c76249a685fb9f9750702a9bec77a0f48bf5677e31f292201a7e3458e4d45b92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef657b7ada196faf65d22070",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了带给每个人\r\n精神与笑容……\r\n让我们一起向前冲吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0630e31313356839196ef33885f73ca10e97cc0a68b5381356d75b82e2001866",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f191bf82cf8bf1fb491d5c5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次再一起去转换心情吧！\r\n上次去了山上，所以下次……\r\n啊哈，光是在脑中计划就好快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3e13289cfe329969a48e11df68277a86b1a4f6fa1aa064a19c06d91a66963e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01cbf1bef2c39cb4a7181191",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年时我家总是很热闹喔～！\r\n我们会跟爸爸的弟子们\r\n一起捣年糕，四处分送给邻居！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a62108c4f074a845d6bec7a3916fd94cd5f8e7396f5bb215ed97554f2c1e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0cdcd8df66fcd61ad002934",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年我增加了友情巧克力的种类，\r\n做成拉绳子抽签的方式！\r\n训练员要不要也抽一个啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2aa794ba3c78d983a0944a7b6ee150d13ede36663e03d43ce0698bcc027cc6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e533c6dfbf5d5a8a840974cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种祭典令人有点害羞……不过\r\n谢谢你平常总是当我的靠山！\r\n这巧克力包含着我所有的感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e3f82da146b9d2f9d2389bc1b0d6ca827cae0a238d7014eb3190bff1a2d16db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aea14bed37e11f8ea17ccd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……要是我能飞上天，\r\n就能代替牛郎与织女做他们的工作，\r\n让他们多多相处了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6968ab005523bbe7401c6d405697a3896f3589ad1e63857be339621b8cc90a6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7720a18b62fa1328f0b9b6ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋！\r\n不给我糖果的话……呃呃，\r\n我就把你扛起来喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d15de2456487cf94126c160b2aaf22ebeb19a9a04271d8dc6775628c43bf0a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:555582d6b6d4407c0bcfe888",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要跟宿舍的大家玩交换礼物喔♪\r\n我准备的礼物是……要帮我保密喔？\r\n是大家可以一起玩的花牌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c137ea215ebb19b252bbad24d191bd4c3a4f1229d8c651cafb545c85d70d0ab9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:079e97022de7cde3905e9134",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天轮到北部圣诞老人\r\n让训练员露出笑容♪\r\n等一下一起吃蛋糕吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21dc976827a8ff9def48cc239200445df2b3b7b728c68d50d235dfb09a48d02c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a075312dbb35ac0869b7627",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了～～！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5464173a9d339517bbb1030fe1a22e1d6a2fde001be8981b499e3b6aca2cec8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e83972d547b96788ce97cc90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，跨年那天你要吃什么口味的\r\n荞麦面呢？我果然还是选红白相间，\r\n看起来很喜气的炸虾荞麦面！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0d1f1e33f5e38154551be0b4f1a2222c1cb1727c8509ee3ecd2a9c9463e5bc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24f145edc745d731f5245819",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐，\r\n训练员！\r\n哟！今天你才是大将！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04a1406871c2ac16694b0b21acbeea3747c4c7ebda6a659dd7c7c51fda42fedf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d87df36969cb7cdb0803509",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了你的生日我特地练习的！\r\n献上我日常的感谢──Happy\r\nbirthday to you～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b5c87bb42e49d39cc7d528f559f407a4772fd8b9c75af42f32442d4614fe15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ff4ef6bdad8fc7cd6e8f15a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么？我脸上挂着开心的微笑？\r\n其实……刚刚大家把我抛高高，\r\n祝我「生日快乐！」喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f562360cba62ccb81992c23ef41679f4d55a4c54e0e4011ece24e25764e8d324",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88ae11c4b7ca536315083bb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……竟然能让训练员为我庆祝\r\n生日……我真是太幸运了……\r\n太感动了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d17faf16ff76d0ef13f99e193953928420662773d6a48bd25528ccc23296b825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02cbc5d4b55e479b69e5ec41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，听说有新公告喔。\r\n由我去确认看看吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "08206d202cd3ec645625246b52582f65be9dab645903222379348bd4f51313a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e016ca2bac9e4e0c578c7dec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有人送礼物来了！\r\n如果手上东西太多，\r\n我来帮忙一起搬！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c951c60181536811a3c5d95b18d1c48aead6d1c4a09e289cc3c82cdc25c717d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:470ac855fbe8be3dc0a95b83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "庆祝达成目标～\r\n嘿呀──！嘿呀──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff341fdf222f85fd1240f4948842636461f946f3cdd67b5cbc8ded38ad2dcf59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efbba1b5f55c11dfb8f94a33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动就快到了……！\r\n真是期待呢……\r\n干脆现在先来事先庆祝！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a54fb320e0c13c8a0f146c63abcd5ca181bf9af7a27934ecc30f3cf7a745e8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c0321dc344cbc9482300a52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祭典不能光用看的！得实际参加！\r\n来吧来吧，我们走！\r\n由我来带领你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5384ffa9735cd4ea00c6c9d37847713daad6d946890e64b3101c10b9d6e6ee51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2f43f7c1678e8720f6e2bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶～真不甘心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ede380eb14a3cb28508773e94e3bf74bf00b630c6773551666a90eebef5fa6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
